"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">12</div><h1>현재완료</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Das Perfekt</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 12의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보조 동사는 두 번째, 과거분사는 문장 끝에 놓아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">규칙·불규칙·혼합 동사의 과거분사를 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">분리동사·비분리동사·-ieren 동사에서 ge-의 자리를 정해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">이동·상태 변화 동사와 bleiben·passieren에 sein을 골라요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;getanzt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Wir haben gestern lange <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(tanzen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 어제 오래 춤을 췄어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir haben gestern lange <b>getanzt</b>.</div>규칙 동사의 과거분사는 ge + 어간 + t예요 — getanzt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bezahlt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Hast du die Rechnung schon <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(bezahlen)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">계산서 벌써 냈어?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hast du die Rechnung schon <b>bezahlt</b>?</div>be-는 비분리 접두어라서 ge-를 붙이지 않아요 — bezahlt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gearbeitet&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Mein Opa hat vierzig Jahre in Hamburg <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(arbeiten)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 할아버지는 40년 동안 함부르크에서 일하셨어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mein Opa hat vierzig Jahre in Hamburg <b>gearbeitet</b>.</div>어간이 -t로 끝나면 -et를 붙여요 — gearbeitet.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;getrunken&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Ich habe heute Morgen keinen Kaffee <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(trinken)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 오늘 아침에 커피를 안 마셨어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe heute Morgen keinen Kaffee <b>getrunken</b>.</div>trinken은 불규칙 동사예요. i → u로 바뀌고 -en이 붙어요 — getrunken.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ist&quot;],[&quot;gefahren&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Lukas <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> letzte Woche nach Wien <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(fahren)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">루카스는 지난주에 빈에 갔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Lukas <b>ist</b> letzte Woche nach Wien <b>gefahren</b>.</div>목적어 없이 장소를 옮기는 fahren은 sein과 써요 — ist gefahren.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sind&quot;],[&quot;aufgewacht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Die Kinder <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> heute sehr früh <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(aufwachen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">아이들은 오늘 아주 일찍 잠에서 깼어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Kinder <b>sind</b> heute sehr früh <b>aufgewacht</b>.</div>aufwachen은 상태가 바뀌는 동사라서 sein이에요.<br>분리동사는 접두어와 동사 사이에 ge가 들어가요 — aufgewacht.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;geöffnet&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Wer hat die Fenster <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(öffnen)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">누가 창문들을 열었어요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wer hat die Fenster <b>geöffnet</b>?</div>öffnen처럼 -ffn으로 끝나는 어간에는 -et를 붙여요 — geöffnet.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gefunden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Ich habe meinen Schlüssel nicht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(finden)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 열쇠를 못 찾았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe meinen Schlüssel nicht <b>gefunden</b>.</div>finden은 i → u로 바뀌는 불규칙 동사예요 — gefunden.<br>nicht는 과거분사 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> reparieren(수리하다)의 과거분사는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) gerepariert</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) repariert</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) reparieren</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) gereparieren</button></div><div class=\"qe\">-ieren 동사는 ge-를 붙이지 않고 -t로 끝나요 — repariert.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> verkaufen(팔다)의 과거분사는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) verkaufen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) verkauft</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) vergekauft</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) geverkauft</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ver-는 비분리라서 ge가 없어요.<br>kaufen은 규칙 동사라서 -t로 끝나요 — verkauft.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Wir <span class=\"qblank\"></span> am Wochenende zu Hause geblieben.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) seid</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) hat</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) haben</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bleiben은 sein과 써요. wir → sind.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ihr die Serie schon gesehen?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Seid</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Habt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Hat</button></div><div class=\"qe\">4격 목적어(die Serie)가 있는 sehen은 haben과 써요. ihr → habt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> '아기는 금방 잠들었어요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Das Baby ist eingeschlafen schnell.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Das Baby hat schnell eingeschlafen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Das Baby ist schnell geeinschlafen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Das Baby ist schnell eingeschlafen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">einschlafen은 상태 변화라서 sein이에요.<br>분리동사 → ein + ge + schlafen, 과거분사는 문장 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe gestern meine Oma angerufen.&quot;,&quot;Gestern habe ich meine Oma angerufen.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 어제 할머니께 전화했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">gestern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">angerufen.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Oma</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">meine</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe gestern meine Oma angerufen.</b></div>보조 동사 habe가 두 번째 자리, 과거분사 angerufen이 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Was hast du gestern gegessen?&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너 어제 뭐 먹었어?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"