<span class=\"qblank\"></span> gestern meinem Lehrer begegnet.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) bin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) habe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) hat</button></div><div class=\"qe\">begegnen(우연히 만나다)은 3격과 쓰지만 보조 동사는 sein이에요. ich → bin.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Mein Vater <span class=\"qblank\"></span> mich gestern nach Hause gefahren.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) habe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) hat</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ist</button></div><div class=\"qe\">fahren에 4격 목적어(mich)가 있으면 '태워 주다'라는 뜻이고 haben과 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ferngesehen&quot;],[&quot;gelesen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> „Hast du gestern <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(fernsehen)</span>?“ – „Nein, ich habe ein Buch <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(lesen)</span>.“</div><div class=\"qko\">&quot;어제 TV 봤어?&quot; – &quot;아니, 책을 읽었어.&quot;</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · „Hast du gestern <b>ferngesehen</b>?“ – „Nein, ich habe ein Buch <b>gelesen</b>.“</div>분리동사 fernsehen → fern + ge + sehen.<br>lesen은 모음이 그대로인 불규칙 동사예요 — gelesen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hast&quot;],[&quot;kennengelernt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Wann <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> du deine Frau <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:15ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(kennenlernen)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 아내를 언제 처음 알게 됐어?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wann <b>hast</b> du deine Frau <b>kennengelernt</b>?</div>kennenlernen은 kennen이 접두어처럼 움직여서 ge가 그 뒤에 들어가요 — kennengelernt.<br>4격 목적어가 있어서 haben이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Ist&quot;],[&quot;passiert&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> dir etwas <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(passieren)</span>?</div><div class=\"qko\">너 무슨 일 있었던 거야? (다친 데 없어?)</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ist</b> dir etwas <b>passiert</b>?</div>passieren은 sein과 쓰고, -ieren 동사라서 ge가 없어요.<br>'누구에게' 일어났는지는 3격(dir)으로 말해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hat&quot;],[&quot;begonnen&quot;],[&quot;bin&quot;],[&quot;gekommen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Das Konzert <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> um acht Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(beginnen)</span> und ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> erst um neun Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(kommen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">콘서트는 8시에 시작했는데 나는 9시에야 왔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Konzert <b>hat</b> um acht Uhr <b>begonnen</b> und ich <b>bin</b> erst um neun Uhr <b>gekommen</b>.</div>beginnen은 haben과 쓰고, be-로 시작해서 ge가 없어요 — hat begonnen.<br>kommen은 이동이라서 sein — bin gekommen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie ist letzten Sommer allein nach Japan gereist.&quot;,&quot;Letzten Sommer ist sie allein nach Japan gereist.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 지난여름에 혼자 일본을 여행했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">gereist.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Japan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">letzten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Sommer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">allein</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie ist letzten Sommer allein nach Japan gereist.</b></div>reisen은 이동이라서 sein이에요.<br>과거분사 gereist가 맨 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Habt ihr das Geschenk schon eingepackt?&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 그 선물 벌써 포장했어?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ihr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Geschenk</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">eingepackt?</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">schon</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Habt</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Habt ihr das Geschenk schon eingepackt?</b></div>einpacken은 분리동사라서 ein + ge + packt예요.<br>Ja/Nein 의문문이라서 보조 동사 Habt가 맨 앞이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bin&quot;],[&quot;aufgestanden&quot;],[&quot;habe&quot;],[&quot;besucht&quot;],[&quot;sind&quot;],[&quot;gelaufen&quot;],[&quot;hat&quot;],[&quot;gekocht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> Am Samstag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> ich erst um zehn Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:14ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(aufstehen)</span>. Am Nachmittag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> ich Mina <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(besuchen)</span>. Wir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> zwei Stunden <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 6\"><span class=\"qh\">(laufen)</span> und am Abend <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 7\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> Mina für mich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 8\"><span class=\"qh\">(kochen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">토요일에 나는 10시에야 일어났어요. 오후에 미나를 찾아갔어요. 우리는 두 시간 동안 걸었고, 저녁에는 미나가 나를 위해 요리했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Am Samstag <b>bin</b> ich erst um zehn Uhr <b>aufgestanden</b>. Am Nachmittag <b>habe</b> ich Mina <b>besucht</b>. Wir <b>sind</b> zwei Stunden <b>gelaufen</b> und am Abend <b>hat</b> Mina für mich <b>gekocht</b>.</div>aufstehen(상태 변화)·laufen(이동)은 sein, besuchen·kochen은 haben이에요.<br>aufgestanden은 ge가 가운데, besucht는 ge가 없어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Wir haben am Sonntag zu Hause geblieben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Der Baum ist schnell gewachsen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich habe ihn sofort erkannt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Sie hat in Köln Musik studiert.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bleiben은 장소를 옮기지 않아도 sein과 써요 — Wir sind … geblieben.<br>erkennen은 er- 비분리 + 혼합 동사라서 erkannt, wachsen은 상태 변화라서 sein이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> '나는 그녀의 차를 라이프치히까지 몰고 갔어요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ich habe ihr Auto nach Leipzig gefahren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich habe ihr Auto gefahren nach Leipzig.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich bin ihr Auto nach Leipzig gefahren.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich habe ihr Auto nach Leipzig gefahrt.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">fahren에 4격 목적어(ihr Auto)가 있으면 haben이에요.<br>fahren은 불규칙이라서 gefahren, 과거분사는 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Hast&quot;],[&quot;gewusst&quot;],[&quot;erfahren&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> „<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben · sein)</span> du das schon <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(wissen)</span>?“ – „Nein, das habe ich erst heute <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(erfahren)</span>.“</div><div class=\"qko\">&quot;그거 벌써 알고 있었어?&quot; – &quot;아니, 오늘에야 알게 됐어.&quot;</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · „<b>Hast</b> du das schon <b>gewusst</b>?“ – „Nein, das habe ich erst heute <b>erfahren</b>.“</div>wissen은 혼합 동사 — gewusst.<br>erfahren(알게 되다)은 er- 비분리라서 ge가 없고, fahren처럼 -en으로 끝나요 — erfahren.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe heute meinen Regenschirm nicht mitgenommen.&quot;,&quot;Heute habe ich meinen Regenschirm nicht mitgenommen.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 오늘 우산을 안 가져갔어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">mitgenommen.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">meinen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Regenschirm</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe heute meinen Regenschirm nicht mitgenommen.</b></div>mitnehmen은 분리 + 불규칙 — mit + ge + nommen.<br>nicht는 과거분사 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 보조 동사가 나머지와 다른 동사는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) einschlafen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) werden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) aufwachen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) schlafen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">schlafen은 자는 상태가 계속되는 것이라서 haben이에요.<br>einschlafen·aufwachen·werden은 상태가 바뀌어서 sein이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"